@prefix c: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/> .
@prefix v: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/> .
@prefix scheme: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/scheme/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

c:graph-algorithm v:uses c:graph-graph-theory .
c:shortest-path-problem skos:related c:path-graph-theory .
c:bayesian-network v:uses c:directed-acyclic-graph .
c:bayesian-network skos:related c:knowledge-representation .
c:boolean-satisfiability skos:related c:np-completeness .
c:static-program-analysis skos:related c:formal-verification .
c:type-inference skos:related c:typing-judgment .
c:simply-typed-lambda-calculus skos:broader c:lambda-calculus .
c:principal-component-analysis skos:related c:singular-value-decomposition .
c:shannon-entropy v:uses c:probability-distributions .
c:markov-chain skos:related c:directed-graph .
c:gradient-descent v:uses c:derivative .
